---
layout: base.njk
title: "Adnan Ahmed Siddiqui | Cloud & EUC Architecture"
home: true
permalink: "/"
---
{%- set list = collections.articles -%}
<header class="home-hero"><div class="wrap">
  <h1>Azure and end-user computing, explained step by step</h1>
  <p class="lead">Articles on Azure landing zones, Azure Virtual Desktop and Windows 365, written for engineers who are new to the topic. Sources are listed at the end of each article.</p>
  <p class="by">By {{ site.author }}, {{ site.role }}</p>
</div></header>

<section class="sec" aria-labelledby="ser-h"><div class="wrap">
  <h2 class="sec-h" id="ser-h">Series</h2>
  <ul class="series-grid">
    {%- for s in collections.liveSeries %}
    <li><a href="/{{ s.slug }}/">
      <strong>{{ s.title }}</strong>
      <span class="sbl">{{ s.short }}</span>
      <span class="sct">{{ s.posts.length }} articles</span>
    </a></li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
</div></section>

<section class="sec" aria-labelledby="new-h"><div class="wrap">
  <h2 class="sec-h" id="new-h">Latest articles</h2>
  <ul class="alist">
    {%- for p in list | mixLatest(articleMeta, 6, 2) %}{% set ser = p.data.tags | seriesOf %}{% set showSeries = true %}{% include "row.njk" %}{% endfor %}
  </ul>
  <p class="all"><a href="/articles/">All articles</a></p>
</div></section>
